    <briefdescription>
<para>Structured logging framework for access model coordinator state transitions. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>ThemisDB | File: <ref refid="access__model__logging_8h" kindref="compound">access_model_logging.h</ref> | Version: 1.0.0 Maturity: 🟡 ALPHA (Phase 5 Implementation) | Status: Active development Author: Copilot | Date: 2026-08-17</para>
<para>Defines structured log entry types for:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>Tier transitions (promotions/demotions)</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Eviction events</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Promotion/demotion decisions</para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
<para>All log entries include:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>Correlation ID for trace correlation</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Thread ID for identifying worker threads</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Timestamp (millisecond precision)</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Operation latency tracking</para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
<para><simplesect kind="see"><para><ref refid="access__coordinator_8h" kindref="compound">include/access_model/access_coordinator.h</ref> </para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="see"><para><ref refid="access__model__trace_8h" kindref="compound">include/access_model/access_model_trace.h</ref> </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
